Package: litReview
Title: Summarizing Graphs for Literature Reviews
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sonsoles", "López-Pernas", email = "sonsoles.lopez@uef.fi",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mohammed", "Saqr", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Provides functions to summarize and visualize categorical data
    from literature reviews. Generates bar charts, waffle charts, donut plots,
    co-occurrence heatmaps, trend charts, and world maps for reporting study
    characteristics across multiple publications.
